\par
hospital admissions, additional procedures, and other medical events. The average costs
\par
per patient in the angioplasty group were NLG 27,354 (standard deviation NLG 16,245);
\par
in the streptokinase group the average costs per patient were NLG 26,264 (standard
\par
deviation NLG 14,570). The ICER was NLG 4,739 per event-free survivor. and the 95\%
\par
one-sided confidence interval was(-=, 24,137].
