The Business Controls are the structured means that the GMS Management uses to help it
\par
achieve the objectives that have been set by the Product Division Management. The long
\par
term top level business plans are set for the sales organization. At the annual Budget
\par
alignment meetings the business policy and targets are agreed with the Product Division
