such support.
\par
Understand customers well, in particular its organization/ key decision
\par
makers/needs and customers own market environment. Be aware of
\par
changing requirements through good personal relationships, ensuring PSC
\par
responds effectively to changes in customer needs.
\par
Be aware of competitor activity in customer accounts and communicating
\par
its effect to Sales Manager, Key Account Manager and Marketing.
\par
Accept ad hoc projects when required to develop and maintain a
\par
professional working relationship with customers.
