\par
As the reader will soon be aware of the distinction between error and uncertainty has
\par
not been maintained in the rest of this report. The main reason is that the two concepts
\par
often are used more or less synonymous by many authors. Therefore, the concept cho-
\par
sen by the author has been kept. The mixed use of uncertainty and error in practical ap-
\par
