available from Treeage Software (http://www.treeage.com/products.htm).
\par
\$ 'HFLVLRQ3UR
\par
'HFLVLRQ3UR is a commercial decision analysis software with the capabilities to build
\par
decision trees and to perform Monte Carlo simulations. The software is available from
