Vanguard, where a demo version can be downloaded (http://www.vanguardsw.com).
\par
\$ '3/
\par
'3/ (Decision Programming Language) is a commercial software offering two major
\par
decision-making tools; influence diagrams and decision trees. Other features include
\par
spreadsheet linking and sensitivity analysis. The software is available from Applied
\par
Decision Analysis, USA (http://www.adainc.com).
\par
\$ ([SHUW\&KRLFH
\par
([SHUW\&KRLFH is a commercial decision support software based on the Analytic Hierar-
\par
chy Process (AHP) methodology for decision making. The program allows building a
\par
model of the decision problem. The best decision is identified by via pair-wise compari-
\par
sons of the relative importance of the variables. The program is available from Palisade
\par
(http://www.palisade.com).
\par
\$ *H1,H
\par
*H1,H is a decision analysis software for Windows, available at no cost for non-
