from the University of Pittsburgh (http://www2.sis.pitt.edu/\textasciitilde genie).
\par
\$ +8*,1
\par
The+8*,1 system is a commercial software for decision analysis based on Bayesian
\par
networks. The software supports construction of graphical networks for the modelling
