\par
\textbf{Modular Concurrency Control}
\par
In this chapter, we summarize our work on \textbf{the }concurrency control part of atomic transaction theory,
\par
which is \emph{part }of Subtask BII. Concurrency control addresses the problem of how \emph{to }run a set of transactions in
\par
a distributed system consistently and correctly with a high degree of concurrency. I'his work is primarily
\par
conducted \textbf{by })r. I.ui Sha and Prof. John P. Lchoczky.
