\textbf{2.2.2. }Vaiue-added Chain and Management Productivity Methods
\par
A second set of approaches seeks to characterize the set of elements which enable a corporation
\par
to formulate and carry out effective business strategy. Wiseman [39, 40, 411, for example, has
\par
identified five categories of strategic impact for IT: differentiation, cost, innovation, growth and
\par
