\par
tion process. A related basis is to consider the role that IT performance evaluation will play in
\par
senior management decision making. The analog that we suggest follows along the lines of the
\par
primal-dual analysis from theory of the firm. The acid test is whether the indirect output which
\par
management wants to link to an IT investment primarily leads to enhancement of value or cost
\par
reduction. This suggests the use of correlation tests which are specialized to gauging IT'S impact
\par
