\par
OECD. They are briefly summarized below.\emph{Ownership of data. }While it is generally held t h a t data, whether in a
\par
physical or electronic manifestation, belongs to the compiler of that
\par
data, there may be some legal constraints to ownership if, lor example,
\par
the data have been illegally acquired. Some would argue that if the data
\par
